# SEO

## Every public page must have

- [ ] **Title** — unique, descriptive, under 60 chars.
- [ ] **Description** — compelling, under 160 chars.
- [ ] **Canonical URL** — `alternates: { canonical }` to prevent duplicates.
- [ ] **OpenGraph** — `title`, `description`, `images`, `url`, `type`.
- [ ] **Twitter Card** — `card: "summary_large_image"`, `title`, `description`, `images`.
- [ ] **Semantic headings** — single `h1`, logical `h2`→`h3` hierarchy.
- [ ] **Image alt text** — descriptive, not "image" or "photo".

## Structured data (JSON-LD)

| Page | Schema |
|------|--------|
| Root layout | `WebSite` + `SearchAction` |
| Beat detail | `MusicRecording` + `BreadcrumbList` |
| Beat pack detail | `Product` + `AggregateOffer` + `BreadcrumbList` |
| Producer profile | `ProfilePage` + `Person` |
| Homepage | `ItemList` (trending beats) |
| About | `FAQPage` |

## Private pages

Dashboard, cart, auth pages: `robots: { index: false, follow: false }`.

## Sitemap & robots

- `src/app/sitemap.ts` — all public pages, dynamic beat/pack/producer pages.
- `src/app/robots.ts` — disallow private paths.
- No auth pages in sitemap.

## Filtered/paginated views

- Filtered URLs (e.g., `/beats?genre=trap`): `robots: { index: false, follow: true }`.
- Canonical always points to the base URL without filters.
